values ('bacc1010-2017-4000-8000-000000000003', 'kh-grade12-science-mathematics-complex-numbers', null, 2017, 'open', 'គេមានចំនួនកុំផ្លិច $z_1=1+i\sqrt{3}$ និង $z_2=6\left(\cos\dfrac{\pi}{4}-i\sin\dfrac{\pi}{4}\right)$។
